# Upload resume state for archive asset scripts.
.blob-upload

# MidJourney capture/engine scratch trees. These are untracked sibling git
# worktrees of a separate repo holding source PNGs; they are never part of the
# application. A CLI `vercel --prod` uploaded midjrny-wt-capture and
# midjrny-wt-engine on 2026-09-04 and the build died in tsc on their
# vite.config.ts (TS2307: cannot find module 'vite'), because tsconfig excluded
# only "midjrny". This file and tsconfig.json both use a glob now.
midjrny*
